###
# TP2 - Pruebas de endpoints
# Requisito: PostgreSQL arriba (docker compose up -d) y app corriendo en
#            http://localhost:8080 (.\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run)
# Usá la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code y hacé clic en "Send Request".
###

### Listar productos (paginado)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/productos?limit=3&skip=0
Accept: application/json

### Producto por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/productos/1
Accept: application/json

### Producto inexistente -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/productos/99999
Accept: application/json

### --- LISTAS ---

### Crear lista -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Regalos"
}

### Crear lista invalida (validacion) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "  "
}

### Listar listas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listas
Accept: application/json

### Obtener lista por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listas/1
Accept: application/json

### Lista inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listas/999
Accept: application/json

### Listar favoritos de una lista
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listas/1/favoritos
Accept: application/json

### Favoritos de lista inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listas/999/favoritos
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar lista vacia -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listas/2

### Eliminar lista inexistente -> 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listas/999

### --- FAVORITOS (ahora con listaId obligatorio) ---

### Crear favorito -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "nota": "Ideal para regalar",
  "listaId": 1
}

### Crear favorito en lista inexistente -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "nota": "Nota",
  "listaId": 999
}

### Crear favorito invalido (validacion) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": -1,
  "nota": "",
  "listaId": 1
}

### Crear favorito sin listaId -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "nota": "Sin lista"
}

### Listar favoritos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos
Accept: application/json

### Obtener favorito por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos/1
Accept: application/json

### Favorito inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos/999
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar favorito -> 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 2,
  "nota": "Nota actualizada",
  "listaId": 1
}

### Eliminar favorito -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/favoritos/1

### --- Mover favoritos (operacion transaccional) ---

### Mover todos los favoritos de la lista 1 a la lista 2 (elimina la lista 1) -> 200 OK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listas/1/mover-favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinoId": 2
}

### Mover a la misma lista -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listas/1/mover-favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinoId": 1
}

### Mover a lista inexistente -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listas/1/mover-favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinoId": 999
}

### --- Swagger ---

### Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json